{"id":"sl/gny5sjyp","index":15,"layout":{"id":"ly/ux4ruhcv","name":"Title Slide"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/3qdg7qpo","kind":"textbox","text":"核心亮点 · AI Agent"},{"id":"sh/8z2h8bq1","kind":"textbox","text":"把自然语言变成可信、可解释、可执行的 SQL"},{"id":"sh/9kby1g7m","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/ytkf2h8j","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/zutgvm94","kind":"textbox","text":"DataMind · 数据库 Agent Web 应用"},{"id":"sh/kv2h4rqp","kind":"textbox","text":"6"},{"id":"sh/lwbyxwra","kind":"textbox","text":"Agent 不是简单调用大模型，而是围绕 Schema、工具与安全策略构建的查询推理系统。"},{"id":"tb/e5cvm94n","kind":"table","text":"能力\t说明\t价值\n自然语言 → SQL\t输入问题，自动生成对应 SQL\t降低取数门槛\nSchema 感知\t自动获取表结构作为上下文\t提升生成准确率\n多轮对话\t保留上下文，可追问与调整\t更自然的交互\nSQL 解释与优化\t解释含义、分析执行计划\t帮助理解与调优\n流式输出\tSSE 实时返回思考过程与结果\t体验透明"}]}
{"id":"sl/14bup87q","index":16,"layout":{"id":"ly/ux4ruhcv","name":"Title Slide"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/d83q1wfa","kind":"textbox","text":"Agent 执行链路"},{"id":"sh/1c7e50ni","kind":"textbox","text":"工具调用 + 失败重试 + few-shot，让结果更可靠"},{"id":"sh/gbedwfmx","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/rm5czq50","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/6lwvql4v","kind":"textbox","text":"DataMind · 数据库 Agent Web 应用"},{"id":"sh/t8ne10n6","kind":"textbox","text":"7"},{"id":"sh/snedsvml","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/jilcvq54","kind":"textbox","text":"用户提问"},{"id":"sh/ihcvml4j","kind":"textbox","text":"自然语言描述需求"},{"id":"sh/4by9or6l","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/pc7qhwn6","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/29grm1of","kind":"textbox","text":"Agent 推理"},{"id":"sh/3ap8fm50","kind":"textbox","text":"Schema 感知 + 历史 few-shot"},{"id":"sh/gnepkr69","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/honqdwnu","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/ulw7ihoj","kind":"textbox","text":"工具调用"},{"id":"sh/fm58bm54","kind":"textbox","text":"表结构 / 采样 / EXPLAIN"},{"id":"sh/0ji9wb6t","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/14rqpgne","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/90nq9gfi","kind":"textbox","text":"生成 SQL"},{"id":"sh/8ze9gbyx","kind":"textbox","text":"只读查询或写操作"},{"id":"sh/ny5876xc","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/mxw7e1gr","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/lwnq5gf6","kind":"textbox","text":"安全执行"},{"id":"sh/0vepcbyl","kind":"textbox","text":"结果 / 图表 / 解释"},{"id":"sh/c7up8ryp","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/2dsn2xwn","kind":"textbox","text":"工具调用"},{"id":"sh/3e1ob2d8","kind":"textbox","text":"list_tables、get_columns、sample_data、explain 四个工具按需调用，最多 3 轮。"},{"id":"sh/oza547ed","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/p0j6dcvy","kind":"textbox","text":"失败重试"},{"id":"sh/e98nydwb","kind":"textbox","text":"READ 查询执行失败时，自动把错误回传给 LLM 修正并重试（默认最多重试3次，可设置）。"},{"id":"sh/fah47idw","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/gbq50neh","kind":"textbox","text":"经验复用"},{"id":"sh/1cj69sv2","kind":"textbox","text":"历史成功 SQL 作为 few-shot（少量示例） 注入新会话，越用越准。"},{"id":"sh/658nudwf","kind":"textbox","text":"不是简单调用大模型，而是把「工具调用、失败自愈、经验复用」做成工程闭环；一次对话通过 SSE 推送 thought / tool / sql / retry / result / chart 等事件，前端逐段渲染。"}]}
{"id":"sl/y5wne50z","index":17,"layout":{"id":"ly/ux4ruhcv","name":"Title Slide"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/rip4retw","kind":"textbox","text":"核心亮点 · 安全执行"},{"id":"sh/wrelszu9","kind":"textbox","text":"AI 可以生成 SQL，但不会拥有不受控的写权限"},{"id":"sh/hsn2l4bu","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/itw3upcf","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/je5knut0","kind":"textbox","text":"DataMind · 数据库 Agent Web 应用"},{"id":"sh/4felwzu5","kind":"textbox","text":"8"},{"id":"tb/hobyd8jy","kind":"table","text":"操作类型\t授权方式\t执行说明\nSELECT / SHOW / DESC / EXPLAIN\t自动执行\t只读查询直接返回结果\nINSERT / UPDATE / DELETE\t手动确认\t返回影响预览与 execution_id\nCREATE / ALTER / DROP / TRUNCATE\t高危确认\t红色警告并展示完整 DDL\n多条混合 SQL\t逐条确认\t按 SQL 类型分别处理"},{"id":"sh/6hw3y9sb","kind":"textbox","text":"execution_id 暂存待确认执行，5 分钟过期；用户确认后再次鉴权，全程审计。"}]}
{"id":"sl/nid43ytk","index":18,"layout":{"id":"ly/ux4ruhcv","name":"Title Slide"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/rqp07290","kind":"textbox","text":"审计与监控"},{"id":"sh/9gb6xgbi","kind":"textbox","text":"让每一次操作都可追溯、可观察"},{"id":"sh/8v2pobax","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/vitozqt8","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/ahk7qls3","kind":"textbox","text":"DataMind · 数据库 Agent Web 应用"},{"id":"sh/xkbq10be","kind":"textbox","text":"15"},{"id":"sh/wj2psvat","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/jmd83atk","kind":"textbox","text":"审计日志"},{"id":"sh/il47u5sz","kind":"textbox","text":"登录、SQL 执行、Agent 动作全量留痕\n操作类型、SQL 文本、状态可追溯\n导出 CSV / XLSX\naudit_retention_days 默认 180 天自动清理"},{"id":"sh/cri1gnql","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/dsri9sr6","kind":"textbox","text":"运维监控"},{"id":"sh/qpgjex8f","kind":"textbox","text":"连接概览与慢查询统计\n不通环境表结构对比）\n定时导出任务状态\n/metrics 暴露 Prometheus 指标"}]}
{"id":"sl/zyxsni5k","index":19,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/qh4nupg7","kind":"textbox","text":"技术亮点 ③：安全、审计与可观测"},{"id":"sh/qpwjmh8n","kind":"textbox","text":"16"},{"id":"sh/rq50vmp8","kind":"textbox","text":"密钥加密、分级授权、全量审计、指标暴露与测试覆盖，构成可交付的企业级完整性。"},{"id":"sh/4nu1krqh","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/po3itc72","kind":"textbox","text":"加密与认证"},{"id":"sh/2lczih8r","kind":"textbox","text":"数据库密码、SSH 私钥、AI Key 经 Fernet 加密入库，接口只返回 has_password / has_key；密码 pbkdf2 哈希，会话使用 httponly Cookie。"},{"id":"sh/3ml0rmpw","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/gjuhg7ql","kind":"textbox","text":"权限与审计"},{"id":"sh/hk3ipcr6","kind":"textbox","text":"按角色控制权限；\nREAD / DML / DDL 分级授权；\n登录、SQL、Agent 动作全量留痕；\n操作类型、SQL 文本、状态可追溯。"},{"id":"sh/dkfmp4zy","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/cj65wzyd","kind":"textbox","text":"可观测与部署"},{"id":"sh/rid4nuhs","kind":"textbox","text":"/metrics 暴露请求数、延迟与 SQL 执行次数；\n117 项后端测试 + Playwright E2E；Docker 多阶段构建，单端口一键启动。"}]}
{"id":"sl/m1wvqtk3","index":20,"layout":{"id":"ly/14ra9krq","name":"Blank"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/sb2lk36t","kind":"textbox","text":"17"},{"id":"sh/1gbmxs7a","kind":"textbox","text":"让每个人都能安全、高效地与数据对话"},{"id":"sh/0f2lon6p","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/qp03yt8n","kind":"textbox","text":"下一步：补齐更多数据库对象支持，扩展 Agent 工具（索引建议、慢查询根因分析），增加团队协作与报表订阅。"}]}